+The default behavior of Click is to rewrap text within each paragraph based
+on the width of the terminal, preserving blank lines between paragraphs.
+In some circumstances, this can become a problem. The main issue is when
+showing code examples, where newlines are significant.
+
+.. versionchanged:: 7.1
+    Paragraph breaks in option help text are preserved.
 
